  "definition": "“Construction commenced” as used in the definition of “existing facility” means",
  "effectiveDate": "2017-08-14",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Hw 100) #12343, eff 8-14-17 (formerly Env-Hw 103.23)",
